# Isolated cargo target roots from native build/measurement waves. These are build
# output, but they were never ignored -- 5534 untracked files, some with paths git
# status itself cannot read ("Filename too long"). That made `git status` unusable
# for spotting a genuinely untracked receipt, which is how an uncommitted test file
# cited as a receipt's evidence stayed invisible until a reviewer checked `git log`.
.cargo-target-*/
